Database & Table Creation:
Created database studentdb.
Created table students_data with columns: id, name, sex, age, school, G3.
Created table schools_data with columns: school, location, type.

Data Import:
Imported students dataset into students_data.
Inserted sample data into schools_data.

SQL Queries:
Selected, filtered, and ordered student data using SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY.
Grouped data using GROUP BY and applied aggregate functions like SUM, AVG, COUNT.
Used subqueries for advanced filtering.

JOINS:
Applied INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, and RIGHT JOIN between students_data and schools_data to combine student and school information.

Views:
Created views for easy analysis:
student_overview → overview of all students.
school_avg_grade → average grade and total students per school.

Query Optimization:
Created an index on the school column in students_data to improve query performance.
